---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy | Leeds Home Guide" description="How Leeds Home Guide handles personal data: what we collect, why, how long we keep it and your rights under UK data protection law." path="/privacy/">
  <section class="page-head"><div class="wrap narrow"><p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> › Privacy</p><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p class="lede">Last updated 11 November 2026.</p></div></section>
  <article class="wrap narrow prose">
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>This website is run by Leeds Home Guide, which is responsible for any personal data you send us. For any privacy question or request, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>You can read the guide without giving us any personal details. If you email us or use a form, we receive what you send, such as your name, email address and message.</p>
    <p>When you send our get listed or contact form, your details pass through our web host, Cloudflare, and a form to email service, FormSubmit, which delivers them to our inbox. We use them only to reply to you and to consider your listing, and we never publish them unless you are listed with your agreement.</p>
    <h2>Why we use it</h2>
    <p>Only to reply to you, to handle a correction or listing request, and to keep a record of it. Our lawful basis is legitimate interests under UK GDPR. We do not sell your details or use them for marketing.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>The site sets no advertising or tracking cookies. If we add visitor statistics, we will use a cookie free tool and update this page first.</p>
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>Messages are kept for up to 2 years, then deleted.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete the personal data we hold about you by emailing <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. If you are unhappy with how we handle it, you can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at ico.org.uk.</p>
    <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
    <p>Our lists link to firms' own websites. Their privacy policies apply once you leave this site.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
